---
title: "onboard_new_asset (Current Finance: Admin)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_dup: assets.supports(CoinType)?
    q_check_dup --> q_error_dup: asset already onboarded
    q_check_dup --> q_create_asset: asset not onboarded
    q_error_dup --> [*]: abort asset_already_onboarded
    q_create_asset --> q_store_asset: asset::new(interest_model, borrow_config)
    q_store_asset --> q_create_reserve: assets.store(asset)
    q_create_reserve --> q_store_reserve: reserve::new(now)
    q_store_reserve --> q_set_tolerance: reserves.store(reserve)
    q_set_tolerance --> q_support_mining: ema_spot_tolerance = 10%
    q_support_mining --> [*]: liquidity_miner.support_coin()

    note right of q_create_asset
        INV-001: each asset onboarded exactly once per market
        INV-002: reserve initialized with zero cash, zero debt, zero supply
        INV-003: borrow_index initialized to 1.0 at current timestamp
        INV-004: all operation paused flags initialized to false
        INV-005: default EMA/spot tolerance = 10% (1000 bps)
    end note
